data: {"type": "message_delta", "delta": "### Kundli Milan \u2014 9.5 of 15 firm points, 21 pending\n\n*A birth time is missing, so the four nakshatra-based kootas (Tara, Yoni, Gana, Nadi \u2014 21 of the 36 points) were not scored. What is below is computed; the rest is genuinely unknown, not estimated.*\n\n**Moon signs:** person 1: Aries (Bharani); person 2: Aquarius (nakshatra unknown without a birth time)\n\n| Koota | Score | What it reads |\n|---|---|---|\n| Varna | 1/1 | spiritual compatibility & ego balance \u2014 Kshatriya + Shudra |\n| Vashya | 1/2 | mutual influence & attraction \u2014 Chatushpada + Manava |\n| Tara | pending | destiny & shared fortune \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n| Yoni | pending | physical & instinctive harmony \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n| Graha Maitri | 0.5/5 | mental connection & friendship \u2014 Mars (neutral of Saturn) / Saturn (enemy of Mars) |\n| Gana | pending | temperament match \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n| Bhakoot | 7/7 | prosperity & family welfare \u2014 11/3 placement |\n| Nadi | pending | health & progeny \u2014 needs a birth time \u2014 this koota is read from the Moon's nakshatra |\n\n"}

